infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Fixture scope: isolate vs amortize
  desc Same Postgres testcontainer (~8s startup), 300 integration tests — scope is the cache key
  compares
    - label function scope — isolate
      children
        - label Setup ~40 min per run
          desc 8s x 300 tests — rebuilt fresh for every test
        - label Object reuse: none
          desc A new instance per test, full isolation
        - label Order-dependent bugs: none
          desc No shared state for a test to mutate
        - label The safe, slow default
          desc Full price for full isolation
    - label session scope — amortize
      children
        - label Setup ~8s per run
          desc Container built once, not 300x — 300x cheaper
        - label Object reuse: every test
          desc The cache hands one object to all consumers
        - label Order-dependent bugs: yes
          desc One mutation -> green alone, red in suite, --lf cannot reproduce
        - label Safe shape: wrap it
          desc Immutable core + function-scoped transaction rollback
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f43f5e
